# Elegant Portfolio

A stylish and elegant portfolio website with 3D animations.

## Quick Start

1. Install dependencies: `npm install`
2. Start the dev server: `npm start`
3. Build for production: `npm build`

## Features

✨ 3D animated hero section  
📱 Responsive design  
🎨 Modern elegant styling  
⚡ Smooth animations  
🚀 Fast performance  

## Customization

- Update your info in `src/components/About.jsx`
- Change colors in `tailwind.config.js`
- Modify 3D effects in `src/components/Hero3D.jsx`

Enjoy your new portfolio! 🎉
